          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ബന്ധം — bandhaṁ — \"a relationship; a tie\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സഹപ്രവർത്തകരുമായി എനിക്ക് നല്ല ബന്ധമാണ്. sahapravarttakarumāyi enikkŭ nalla bandhamāṇŭ. I have a good relationship with my colleagues."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ബന്ധു, a relative, shares its root; ബന്ധപ്പെടുക is to get in touch."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ബന്ധം (bandhaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit bandha, \"a bond, a tie\" (CDIAL 9136)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
